{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54285","headline":"秋晚云溪隐者居 · 高蟾","name":"秋晚云溪隐者居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野寺秋声苦，灵溪晚翠荒。\n人家红树老，天气白云深。\n泽国尘埃少，山川岁月长。\n明时一樽酒，谁作钓沧浪？\n（影印本《诗渊》第五册第三一六二页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}